---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import career from '../data/career.json';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Allen Akin: founder of InfraRed, data scientist, technologist, and photographer.">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <PageIntro eyebrow="About" title="Building is only part of the story." description="I’m a technologist and founder interested in how complex systems become useful, legible products. The rest of my attention goes to music, photographs, books, and the many good questions between disciplines." accent="black" />

    <section class="about-lead">
      <h2>I like working where ideas meet the real world.</h2>
      <div class="about-prose">
        <p>I’m the founder of <strong>InfraRed</strong>, where I’m building financial operations software for construction. Construction is full of consequential decisions, complicated relationships, and information that rarely arrives in a neat shape. I’m interested in making that work clearer and more dependable.</p>
        <p>Before InfraRed, I was a senior manager in EY’s data science team. I worked with teams trying to turn machine learning and emerging technology into systems people could actually use. Earlier, I worked as an AI scientist at a bank, building applied AI in an environment where rigor, reliability, and trust matter.</p>
        <p>Those chapters taught me that a model is never the whole product. The interesting work lives in the translation: understanding a problem properly, building the right thing, and making it hold up in practice.</p>
        <p>Away from work, I listen widely, collect records, read across science and culture, and take photographs. Those interests are not a sidebar to how I think. They sharpen my attention, give me new structures to borrow, and remind me that usefulness and beauty can belong in the same object.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="career-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="career-heading">Selected chapters</h2><p>Work so far</p></div>
      <div class="career-list">
        {career.sort((a, b) => a.order - b.order).map((item) => (
          <article class="career-item">
            <span class="period">{item.period}</span>
            <h3>{item.organization}<span>{item.role}</span></h3>
            <p>{item.summary}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="interests-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="interests-heading">Elsewhere on the desk</h2><p>Follow an interest</p></div>
      <nav class="interest-band" aria-label="Allen's interests">
        <a href="/music">Music</a><a href="/photos">Photography</a><a href="/books">Books</a><a href="/math">Mathematics</a><a href="/tech">Technology</a>
      </nav>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
